Teewars Legacy
----------------------
What is Teewars legacy
	Teewars Legacy - inspired by teeworlds game made in 2000s indie opensource games style (Like pingus, hedgewars, etc) 
	with 2000s technologies like SDL 1.2, SDL_mixer 1.2.
Features of project
- Oldschool sources structure like in 2000s games
- Oldschool pixelated GFX like in 2000s games
- Vector based map like in old Beta Teewars from 2003-2004
- 2 Maps
Recources
	TWL Website - https://teewarslegacy.com.ua/
